# --- Engine-generated. Regenerates locally, never committed. See docs/PIPELINE.md §2. ---
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
Saved/
.vs/

# --- IDE solution/project files ---
# Unreal regenerates these from the .uproject and they contain machine-specific paths, so
# committing them hands every teammate a spurious diff they didn't cause.
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# --- Cook and packaging artifacts ---
# Today this is only Build/<Platform>/FileOpenOrder/*.log, which the cooker writes.
# NOTE: if an app icon or splash screen is ever added under Build/<Platform>/Resources/,
# those are real build inputs and must be committed — un-ignore them explicitly then.
Build/

# --- Packaged builds ---
# These are archived outside the repo (H:\Unreal\Projects\Builds) and distributed via itch,
# never through Git — see docs/PIPELINE.md §6. These entries are a guard in case someone
# ever points -archivedirectory inside the project by mistake; a packaged build is ~2 GB of
# derived artifacts and LFS history cannot be pruned server-side.
/Builds/
/Packaged/
/Dist/

# --- Claude Code ---
# Local session state and personal settings. If the team ever wants shared tool
# permissions, commit .claude/settings.json explicitly rather than un-ignoring the folder.
.claude/
